 "description": "Twitch usernames and channel names that fit the rules: streamer brands, cosy, funny and chat-friendly names, with your own word or name if you like.",
 "seoKeywords": "twitch name generator, twitch username generator, twitch channel name ideas, twitch name ideas, twitch username ideas, cool twitch names, funny twitch names, cute twitch names, streamer name generator, streamer name ideas",
 "isPopular": false,
 "noun": "Twitch Names",
 "noEcho": true,
 "maxLength": 25,
 "nameSource": {
  "kind": "invented",
  "note": "Names are built from word lists written for this page, in the patterns streamers use: a brand with TV or Live on the end, short names that are easy to type in chat, cosy pairs and jokes about how you play. Every name is 4 to 25 characters of letters, numbers and underscores, as Twitch requires. Brands, games and the names of well-known streamers were checked for and left out. This page is not made by or connected with Twitch or Amazon."
 },
